[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Shinya "Ms. Konno. Hello. Buying something?"[p]
Konno "Yes, I'm getting some reference books. Are those... sleeping pills?"[p]
Konno "Are you having trouble sleeping?"[p]
Shinya "Y-Yeah... I haven't been sleeping well lately and I still wake up tired in the mornings so I thought I'd try these."[p]
Konno "If that's the case, wouldn't you want to start with something milder first?"[p]
Shinya "It's fine, I was looking for something strong anyway... Haha."[p]
Konno "Really? You can try it, but if your condition gets worse, you should stop right away."[p]
(Damn, she caught me buying sleeping pills... Well, as long as no one finds out what I'm using them for.)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

