Shinya "Haha... I was just curious. Does it actually have an effect?"[p]
Konno "I wonder myself. Most of the time, these just tend to be only in name... It might be interesting to try it out."[p]
Konno "Oh, but don't let Yume smell it okay? She's got no resistance to men. Things might get complicated."[p]
Shinya "Oh of course I wouldn't...!"[p]
Konno "Of course not, heh. Sorry, that was out of line. Anyway, see you."[p]
